	(text_box "LAYOUT NOTE L1:\n• J2 and C3 on the FPGA island; U1 straddles the barrier (pins 1-3 FPGA side, 5-8 board side)\n• Pads 3 / 5 are 3.28 mm apart: own rule in the .kicad_dru"
